{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicker Ore is an idle/clicker mining game where you battle increasing heat as you dig deeper. The deeper you go, the harder the ores become, your mining power decreases, and you must upgrade your equipment to survive. Upgrade your heat suit, unlock special pickaxes, develop your skills, and push your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/extras/aac6455311a20e4ffbe002b1e6078a8a.avif?t=1765219218\" alt=\"\"width=184 height=184 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/extras/0d74ace3941d52840bfa6ebbf9d86e68.avif?t=1765219218\" alt=\"\"width=184 height=184 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/extras/622223b7115d97ef7d1bccdcadb09616.avif?t=1765219218\" alt=\"\"width=184 height=184 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/extras/5f68df87ba339e1d681828a71a1b8d79.avif?t=1765219218\" alt=\"\"width=184 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickaxes and Progression</strong><br>Unlock new pickaxes, use passive abilities, and create your own playstyle. Progress continuously by auto-mining beyond your first pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heat Mechanics</strong><br>As you descend deeper, heat increases and your mining power decreases. Return to the safe upper layers to earn gold, or upgrade your heat suit to venture into lower levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and Prestige</strong><br>The quest system continuously refreshes and offers rewards based on your progress. Gain permanent boosts through prestige, becoming stronger with each reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Dungeons</strong><br>Enter dungeons with keys, defeat bosses, and collect valuable loot. Short but intense battles await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills and Pets</strong><br>Develop active skills to create powerful combinations. Pet creatures significantly increase your mining power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and Competition</strong><br>Track your development with offline earnings, automated systems, and detailed statistics. Compete through achievements and global leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Economy and Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is completely free to play. If you wish, you can speed up your progress by purchasing diamonds, dungeon keys, and cosmetic items. Pets can be purchased with diamonds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, descend, manage heat, complete quests, upgrade your equipment, defeat bosses, gain permanent power through prestige, and make your mark on the leaderboards.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810540?t=1765219218","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/ffa2524b177244c98019581d8b2ee9ac066398cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765219218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/5bb15e0354292b4bbb6bbe0779cbdeb68a36cb8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765219218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/5bb15e0354292b4bbb6bbe0779cbdeb68a36cb8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765219218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{