d your mining power decreases. Return to the safe upper layers to earn gold, or upgrade your heat suit to venture into lower levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and Prestige</strong><br>The quest system continuously refreshes and offers rewards based on your progress. Gain permanent boosts through prestige, becoming stronger with each reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Dungeons</strong><br>Enter dungeons with keys, defeat bosses, and collect valuable loot. Short but intense battles await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills and Pets</strong><br>Develop active skills to create powerful combinations. Pet creatures significantly increase your mining power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and Competition</strong><br>Track your development with offline earnings, automated systems, and detailed statistics. Compete through achievements and global leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Economy and Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is completely free to play. If you wish, you can speed up your progress by purchasing diamonds, dungeon keys, and cosmetic items. Pets can be purchased with diamonds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, descend, manage heat, complete quests, upgrade your equipment, defeat bosses, gain permanent power through prestige, and make your mark on the leaderboards.</p>","developers":["Tiny Depth Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810540/273b7f7d7e849ed36aa76dae0a8ba6d597bcd2f6/header.jpg?t=1765219218","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"m